    },
    {
      "displayText": "While I am certain no explanation is needed, I am\nin a rather chatty mood today, so allow me to<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ndelight you with the details of this event.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIn this tournament, you have the honor of facing\noff against me—and only me—in an infinite loop<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nof battles where your sole aim is to rack up wins!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
